# Rules to skip for specific paths
# Format: RULE/name:path/glob
#
# Every entry requires a tracking issue. No blanket category ignores.

# WHY(#128): retained-assets/ holds content-addressed copies of published
# cast driver scripts (bin/asset_retention.py) and static/tapes/ holds the
# reproduction recipes those casts link to. Both are site content served to
# visitors, not repo tooling this project runs -- linting them as repo shell
# scripts is a category error, and retained-assets/ is additionally
# append-only by design, so editing the files to satisfy the rules would
# break the ledger's hash chain.
SHELL/*:retained-assets/**
SHELL/*:static/tapes/**
